id: pm-wtqltn
title: Expose host-bound audited workspace settings mutation to extension commands
description: "A packed extension can apply settings directly but lacks a portable host SDK transaction that preserves the workspace audit chain, leaving strict health with settings history drift."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-29T00:20:00.805Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-29T06:53:32.125Z"
