completed_at: "2026-09-29T06:50:55.143Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: Host-bound extension SDK mutation writes settings and workspace history atomically; Packed extension without local CLI SDK dependency passes strict health and rollback tests
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: high
confidence: 80
severity: high
resolution: "Added typed injected SDK settings mutation with fixed project scope, validation, locking, workspace history, dry-run, idempotent replay, and caller attribution."
expected_result: A copied extension can change governed settings without a local SDK while retaining strict history and health.
actual_result: "Copied-extension integration and source-level failure/preview/replay tests pass; linked tests, full suite, exact coverage, and static quality pass."
affected_version: 2026.9.28
component: SDK extension command context
