body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1345\n\nExpose a typed extension-command SDK operation for lock-scoped audited singleton mutation with invocation identity, atomic write and history, compensation, idempotence, and dry-run. Prove a packed extension without a local host SDK dependency can apply settings and pass strict health."
